WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:05.640
Running resident services at an affordable housing property means living by your LURA.

2
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:11.640
Every promise in it, the classes, the events, the paperwork, has to be delivered and proven.

3
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.640
Meet ROSA, the Roseway Operations System.

4
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.140
ROSA turns your compliance documents into a full year of resident programs,

5
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.140
prepares every flier and sign-in sheet for you,

6
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:27.640
and shows you, month by month, exactly where you stand.

7
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.640
For property managers, it all starts with one dashboard.

8
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:36.140
A getting started checklist walks you through onboarding, step by step.

9
00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:40.140
And at a glance, you see this month's events, how many residents checked in,

10
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.140
which documents are still due, and what's coming up next.

11
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:48.640
Upload your LURA, amendments and regulatory agreements once.

12
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.140
ROSA checks each document automatically,

13
00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:53.640
finds every resident service requirement,

14
00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:59.140
and explains any issue in plain language, so nothing slips through.

15
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.140
Roseway then drafts your annual service plan, built from your LURA and your preferences.

16
00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:09.140
Your event days, blackout dates, budget, and the programs your residents want.

17
00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:12.640
Review it and approve it in one click.

18
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:16.140
Every month, your event package arrives automatically.

19
00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:21.140
The calendar, flyers, sign-in sheets and resident handouts, ready to share.

20
00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:26.640
Residents check-in at each event, and attendance flows straight into your dashboard.

21
00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:31.140
The uploads tracker shows what's complete in green and what's missing in red,

22
00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:33.640
so audit time is never a scramble.

23
00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:39.640
And if you ever need help, raise a ticket and Roseway answers right inside the portal.

24
00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:45.640
Regional managers get everything a property manager does, plus one powerful switch.

25
00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.140
Move between every property in your portfolio in a single click,

26
00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:53.140
and see which sites are on track and which need attention.

27
00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:58.140
Behind the scenes, the Roseway team runs it all from the operations dashboard.

28
00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.140
Every property and where it sits in the pipeline,

29
00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:07.640
document validation results, and support tickets waiting for a reply, all in one view.

30
00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:13.140
Compliance reviewers sign off each property against a 48-hour target.

31
00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:17.640
Then ROSA matches every LURA requirement to a program from the library,

32
00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:21.140
so the right services are always delivered.

33
00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:26.140
The planner drafts 12 months of events, checks each one against the LURA's rules,

34
00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.140
and even works around holidays.

35
00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:32.640
Then the package generator sends each month's documents to the property manager,

36
00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:36.640
by email, and straight into their ROSA folder.

37
00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:42.140
Less paperwork, fewer compliance gaps, and residents who feel cared for and stay.

38
00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:46.640
ROSA by Roseway Resident Services. Book your demo today.

